{"id":8,"createdAt":"{D+0}T12:00:00.000Z","title":"gaza ceasefire, fed rates","content":"## top stories\n<u>**gaza ceasefire holds**</u>\nThe ceasefire held for a third day.\n\nAid deliveries rose.\n## more news\n<u>**fed holds rates**</u>\nThe Fed held rates at 4.25%.","tldrProse":"The ceasefire held; the Fed *held* rates.","usedArticles":4,"usedSources":2,"sources":[{"name":"Beta Wire","articles":[{"title":"beta article 101","url":"https://beta.example.com/101"},{"title":"beta article 102","url":"https://beta.example.com/102"},{"title":"beta article 104","url":"https://beta.example.com/104"},{"title":"beta article 105","url":"https://beta.example.com/105"},{"title":"beta article 112","url":"https://beta.example.com/112"}]},{"name":"Alpha News","articles":[{"title":"alpha article 06","url":"https://alpha.example.com/06"}]}],"sourceArticleCount":6}
